誦，是人當為一切諸佛及諸菩薩，乃至一切天、龍、藥叉、阿素洛、揭路茶、緊捺洛、莫呼落伽之所擁護。」時薄伽梵說此經已，金剛手菩薩摩訶薩，及釋、梵、護世天人、阿素洛、健闥縛等一切眾會，聞佛所說，歡喜奉行。護命法門神呪經校注經藏唐天竺三藏流揵唯茶唯反上平上上嚟上下上茶茶二十二囉柱婆上入入茶茶<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00653.gif\" alt=\"𡆆\" title=\"𡆆\" />茶蒲上入<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00074.gif\" alt=\"𠼝\" title=\"𠼝\" />五上聲上上上上一上茶哩上社禰反去入茶哩柁十放此<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01365.gif\" alt=\"䞘\" title=\"䞘\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01365.gif\" alt=\"䞘\" title=\"䞘\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01365.gif\" alt=\"䞘\" title=\"䞘\" />日<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00231.gif\" alt=\"㰤\" title=\"㰤\" />思唯茶茶徒平<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00074.gif\" alt=\"𠼝\" title=\"𠼝\" />乾<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00074.gif\" alt=\"𠼝\" title=\"𠼝\" />平平上上捨摩蚶天上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" />上去杖鼻入下同入去平平入入<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00074.gif\" alt=\"𠼝\" title=\"𠼝\" />上入入<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00653.gif\" alt=\"𡆆\" title=\"𡆆\" />上入上平閃入閃閃閃上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/02/CB02740.gif\" alt=\"𠼐\" title=\"𠼐\" />上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/02/CB02740.gif\" alt=\"𠼐\" title=\"𠼐\" />入犁平平平平平<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/03/CB03868.gif\" alt=\"𪘜\" title=\"𪘜